     "body": "<p>Holding off on this ticket until <a href=\"https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3159\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.lyrasis.org/browse/FCREPO-3159</a> has been resolved.<br/>\nSpecifically, the RepositoryInitializer (<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1599/files#diff-9fe4d701d75648e5f697de35567e71beR43\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1599/files#diff-9fe4d701d75648e5f697de35567e71beR43</a>) is important for this work, but the changes to LinkHeaderProvider (<a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1599/files#diff-1dd051f8732f188465332362fd183ad6L52\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/1599/files#diff-1dd051f8732f188465332362fd183ad6L52</a>) appear to be breaking changes.</p>",
